url: "https://upwind-explorer.vercel.app"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-29
abstract: >-
  UPWIND is an open-source software project and public atlas for
  exploring historical PM2.5 air quality across the United States. It combines
  Census place estimates, EPA monitoring station measurements, and industrial
  emissions inventory records while keeping evidence layers distinct.
keywords:
  - air quality
  - PM2.5
  - environmental data
  - research software
